                                "sense_id": "9cdc0c3d-774f-3030-85f7-c3a2057f9ea8",
                                "text": "There twice a day the Severn fills,\n⁠The salt sea-water passes by,\n⁠And hushes half the babbling Wye,\nAnd makes a silence in the hills."
